{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":19,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":19,"text":"  verdict : MIDPOINT MEAN IS 42, COMPUTED CORRECTLY","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":20,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":20,"text":"","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":21,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":21,"text":"  taking the honest weighted mean of the midpoints over","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":22,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":22,"text":"  every respondent is the part done right here, and it is","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":23,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":23,"text":"  why 42 is the correct mean of the midpoints","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":24,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":24,"text":"","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":25,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":25,"text":"the midpoint substitution","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":26,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":26,"text":"  what is recorded : the bucket, never the age","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":27,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":27,"text":"  what the midpoint assumes : the age sits at the bucket's","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":28,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":28,"text":"    center","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":29,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":29,"text":"  when that holds : only if ages are symmetric within each","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":30,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":30,"text":"    bucket","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":31,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":31,"text":"  the real distribution : skews old, and the top bucket is","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":32,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":32,"text":"    open-ended with a guessed center","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":33,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":33,"text":"  so the midpoint mean : is the mean of the assumption, not","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":34,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":34,"text":"    of the ages","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":35,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":35,"text":"","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":36,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":36,"text":"the result of the survey","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":37,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":37,"text":"  reported average age : 42","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":38,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":38,"text":"  average from the raw ages : 47","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":39,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":39,"text":"  years hidden by the bucketing : 5","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":40,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":40,"text":"  is the midpoint mean miscomputed : no; 42 is exact for","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":41,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":41,"text":"    the midpoints","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":42,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":42,"text":"  is 42 the average age : no; interval censoring replaced","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":43,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":43,"text":"    each age with a center it need not sit at","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":44,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":44,"text":"","end":"\n"}
