{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":48,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":48,"text":"null control - record the raw age, not only the bucket","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":49,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":49,"text":"  mean from midpoints : 42","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":50,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":50,"text":"  mean from raw ages : 47","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":51,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":51,"text":"  years the raw value recovers : 5","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":52,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":52,"text":"  no respondent and no bucket boundary changed; each age","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":53,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":53,"text":"  stopped being read as its bucket's center and started","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":54,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":54,"text":"  being read as itself","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":55,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":55,"text":"","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":56,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":56,"text":"what a mean of bucket midpoints guarantees","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":57,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":57,"text":"  it is the correct mean of the midpoints : exactly, real","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":58,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":58,"text":"    buckets, every respondent, honest weighting","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":59,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":59,"text":"  it is the mean of the ages : not addressed; only the","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":60,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":60,"text":"    bucket is recorded, so each age becomes its bucket's","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":61,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":61,"text":"    center, and a skewed distribution plus an open top","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":62,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":62,"text":"    bucket moves the true mean to 47","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":63,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":63,"text":"","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":64,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":64,"text":"a bucket keeps which interval a value fell in and forgets where inside it; the","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":65,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":65,"text":"midpoint puts it back at the center, which is a fact about the interval, not the","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":66,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":66,"text":"value, and a skew within the bucket is invisible to a mean of centers","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":67,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":67,"text":"","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":68,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":68,"text":"It takes the honest weighted mean of the midpoints over every respondent - 42 is","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":69,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":69,"text":"the exact midpoint mean. But only the bucket was recorded, so each age is read as","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":70,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":70,"text":"its center; with a skewed distribution and an open top bucket the true mean is 47,","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":71,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":71,"text":"1063 per ten thousand understated, until the raw age is recorded.","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":72,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:run:done","mono":72,"ok":true,"outputs":62,"anomalies":0}
